      <description>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;a href=&#34;https://forms.gle/n3eBBJbT6HeQRMts7&#34;&gt;mechanical mailbag&lt;/a&gt; for the next double feature is &lt;strong&gt;open until October 30th&lt;/strong&gt;– tell us about how you&amp;rsquo;d turn &lt;em&gt;Xanadu&lt;/em&gt; (1980) or &lt;em&gt;Rollerball&lt;/em&gt; (1975) into a TTRPG and we might talk about it on the show!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Join the second &lt;a href=&#34;https://itch.io/jam/this-should-be-a-game-jam-02&#34;&gt;This Should Be a Game! Jam&lt;/a&gt; and make something inspired by &lt;em&gt;In the Mouth of Madness&lt;/em&gt; or &lt;em&gt;The Thing&lt;/em&gt;!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;iframe src=&#34;https://player.rss.com/this-should-be-a-game/3110728?theme=dark&amp;v=2&#34; width=&#34;100%&#34; height=&#34;202px&#34; title=&#34;The Thing (1982) - 01 - with Alyssa&#34; frameBorder=&#34;0&#34; allow=&#34;accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture&#34; allowfullscreen scrolling=&#34;no&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://rss.com/podcasts/this-should-be-a-game/3110728/&#34;&gt;The Thing (1982) - 01 - with Alyssa | RSS.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Talking with Alyssa (&lt;a href=&#34;https://bsky.app/profile/adisasterqueer.bsky.social&#34;&gt;@adisasterqueer&lt;/a&gt;) about how to turn 1982&amp;rsquo;s &lt;em&gt;The Thing&lt;/em&gt; into a TTRPG.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
